  "answer_text": "Great news \u2014 **Miraculous Ladybug Season 2, Episode 12 has already aired!** It is not an upcoming episode. Here are the details depending on the episode numbering/order used:\n\n- **By production/official order:** Episode 12 is titled **\"Sapotis.\"** In this episode, while Marinette and Alya are having a sleepover, Alya's little sisters Etta and Ella get akumatized by Hawk Moth and become the Sapotis \u2014 small, out-of-control monsters who multiply upon eating and wreak havoc across the city.\n\n- **By Netflix/international broadcast order:** Episode 12 is titled **\"Gorizilla.\"** It aired on **May 13, 2018**, and follows Adrien's bodyguard getting akumatized into Gorizilla, who is endowed with extraordinary strength and an acute sense of smell to track Adrien all through Paris.\n\nSo if you're waiting for this episode, you don't need to \u2014 it has long been available! You can watch it on platforms like **Netflix** or **Disney+**, where Miraculous Ladybug is available for streaming.",
